Package: edubr
Type: Package
Title: Acquisition and Reading of Educational Data from MEC and INEP
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Rodrigo", "Borges",
      email = "rodrigo@borges.net.br",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Download and tidy Brazilian basic education indicators published by
    INEP/MEC: IDEB (Índice de Desenvolvimento da Educação Básica), AFD (Adequação
    da Formação Docente), and age-grade distortion rates (Taxa de Distorção
    Idade-Série) at the municipality level, plus a table of federal university
    and institute campuses by municipality derived from the Censo da Educação
    Superior. Functions download the original spreadsheets from INEP, parse
    their hierarchical multi-row headers, and return harmonized long-format
    tibbles.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://rodrigoesborges.github.io/edubr/, https://github.com/rodrigoesborges/edubr
BugReports: https://github.com/rodrigoesborges/edubr/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    curl,
    dplyr,
    janitor,
    readxl,
    stringi,
    tibble,
    tidyr
